flowchart LR
    A[Answer text or transcript] --> B[Normalize\ncleaning, sentences, tokens]
    B --> C[Feature extraction]
    C --> C1[Keywords and entities]
    C --> C2[Embeddings]
    C --> C3[Answer length and timing]
    C --> C4[Filler and speech rate]
    C --> D[Reference comparison]
    D --> D1[Exact phrase]
    D --> D2[TF-IDF cosine]
    D --> D3[Embedding similarity]
    C --> E[Rubric signals]
    E --> E1[Relevance]
    E --> E2[Technical correctness]
    E --> E3[Completeness]
    E --> E4[Structure and evidence]
    C4 --> F[ML model\nLR / SVM / Random Forest]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G[NVIDIA LLM explanation]
    G --> H[Schema validation]
    H --> I[Application score aggregation]
    I --> J[Feedback, next question, dashboard]
    style A fill:#2563eb,color:#fff
    style F fill:#f59e0b,color:#111827
    style G fill:#76b900,color:#fff
    style I fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
